<title>USA: Sunrise, Fla., utility bonds yld 5.938 pct in 2026.</title>
<headline>Sunrise, Fla., utility bonds yld 5.938 pct in 2026.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
